exports[`deepMerge vs configMergeDeep comparison multiple object merging all three merge with left-to-right precedence 1`] = `
{
  "explain": 
"✅ 多物件優先順序：三個函式都是左側優先（override > user > defaults）
Multiple objects precedence: all three use leftmost wins (override > user > defaults)"
,
